# offsets, field ranges, resets and implemented-bit masks the .rdl describes
# (report R8a); every one of the twenty-two is listed here whether or not its
# entity has adopted it yet, because a package no entity `use`s costs one
# analysis and nothing else, and a wave that adopts one then has no BUILD file
# to edit.
# hdl/common/sim/ClkGate.vhd is the behavioural model; the ARM cell of the same
# entity name in commune/ is the synthesis view and must NOT be in these lists.
